  "version": {
    "script_id": "07c8442c5baa4807bf1d32b21e8a543f",
    "version": 1,
    "title": "DeepSeek 开源推理引擎 DeepInfer：给了引擎，没给服务",
    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "开源的是引擎，不是服务",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "text": "DeepSeek 把生产环境在用的推理引擎 DeepInfer 开源了，谁都能下载。它专门跑 V4.1 Flash 这个快速版模型，Apache-2.0 许可。",
            "citations": [
              "https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepInfer",
              "https://siliconangle.com/2026/10/20/deepseek-open-sources-deepinfer-the-inference-framework-behind-its-production-services/",
              "https://dailylaunch.org/p/deepinfer"
            ],
            "evidence": "CITED",
            "note": "已按审计意见改写"
          },
          {
            "text": "但开源的是引擎，不是能对外服务的系统。缓存管理和多副本负载均衡这两项明确没给，仓库单列了一节写着本次发布不包含，理由是跟内部基础设施绑得太深。",
            "citations": [
              "https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepInfer",
              "https://qz.com/deepseek-open-source-deepinfer-inference-software-ai-102026"
            ],
            "evidence": "CITED",
            "note": "已按审计意见改写"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "只认两种卡",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "text": "硬件也窄，只认英伟达最新的 SM100 和华为昇腾 950，H100、A100 这些更早的卡都不在支持列表里。",
            "citations": [
              "https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepInfer",
              "https://www.neoteo.com/en/deepseek-opens-deepinfer-for-offline-inference-on-sm100-and-ascend-950"
            ],
            "evidence": "CITED",
            "note": "已按审计意见改写"
          },
          {
            "text": "还有两项只在英伟达上可用：batch-invariant inference 和 deterministic sampling，保证同一份输入，不管怎么拼批、跑几次，结果都一样。昇腾用户拿不到。",
            "citations": [
              "https://www.neoteo.com/en/deepseek-opens-deepinfer-for-offline-inference-on-sm100-and-ascend-950",
              "https://siliconangle.com/2026/10/20/deepseek-open-sources-deepinfer-the-inference-framework-behind-its-production-services/"
            ],
            "evidence": "CITED",
            "note": "已按审计意见改写"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "两个数字的口径",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "text": "官方说单集群一天服务 155 万亿 token，每张卡每小时收入 38 美元。这是谷价时段——非高峰——的收入，不是利润，也还没第三方独立测过。",
            "citations": [
              "https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepInfer/blob/main/doc/inference_deployment_qa.md",
              "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-20/deepseek-unveils-open-source-tool-to-help-cut-ai-operating-costs"
            ],
            "evidence": "CITED",
            "note": "已按审计意见改写"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "值得抄的两个技巧",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "text": "其中一个技巧是投机解码：草稿模型一次先提 5 个 token，主模型再校验哪些能用。高并发下吞吐能高 4% 到 7%，并发一低反而会变慢。",
            "citations": [
              "https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepInfer/blob/main/doc/inference_deployment_qa.md",
              "https://www.neoteo.com/en/deepseek-opens-deepinfer-for-offline-inference-on-sm100-and-ascend-950"
            ],
            "evidence": "NEEDS_REVIEW",
            "note": "已按审计意见改写；事实审计：报告把 DSpark 的 +4%~7% 明确标注为「厂商自述，未独立验证」，并注明这是「生产负载下」的厂商估计；「−1.5%」也只是 16 seq/rank 这一个测试点的数据。讲稿把两组厂商数据都写成无条件的事实结论，既没交代来源，也没说明这是单点数据。"
          },
          {
            "text": "另一招是缓存没命中时，只重算最后 128 个 token，模型读输入那一步的总计算量能减近一半。想动手的话，先读仓库里那份部署问答。",
            "citations": [
              "https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepInfer/blob/main/doc/inference_deployment_qa.md",
              "https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepInfer"
            ],
            "evidence": "CITED",
            "note": "已按审计意见改写"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
